# Records vs classes

- `record`: mediator commands and queries, simple GraphQL inputs.
- `class`: handlers, gRPC adapters, entities, EF configs, GraphQL extensions, mappers, DataLoaders.

```csharp
public record CreatePageCommand(CreatePageRequest Request)
    : IRequest<CreatePageResponse>;

public class CreatePageHandler { }
```
